    B -->|Elastin| F[Elastin Production]
    
    C --> G[Collagen Fibril Formation]
    G --> H[Collagen Cross-linking]
    H --> I[Collagen Matrix]
    
    D --> J[Fibronectin Dimerization]
    J --> K[Fibronectin Matrix]
    
    E --> L[Proteoglycan Assembly]
